  "note": "Election of the Gilford Town Commissioners, poll fixed for 15 May 1936 (the January 1935 round having been deferred by the Local Government Act (Northern Ireland) 1934). The Belfast News-Letter reports that the retiring Town Commissioners of Gilford were re-elected, naming all nine. Citation unconfirmed: the names were not all found on the cited page (verification 5 Nov 2026). Returned unopposed."
